<title>NETHERLANDS: WolterS: no short-term share-split plan.</title>
<headline>WolterS: no short-term share-split plan.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch publisher Wolters Kluwer NV said on Monday it had no plans to split its shares in the short term, although it did not rule out such a move in the longer term.</p>
</text>
